{"seq":3,"slug":"military-technology","title":"军事技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"军事技术-学科简介\">军事技术 — 学科简介</h1><blockquote>\n<p><strong>阶段：</strong> 完成 | <strong>更新于：</strong> 2026-06-23 | <strong>族系：</strong> E（教育自学型）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-是什么\">本 hub 是什么</h2><p>「军事技术」聚焦<strong>装备与技术系统本身</strong>——它讲的是武器、传感器、平台、能量束、算法这些<strong>物的层面</strong>：一枚洲际导弹如何在大气层外飞行、一束激光为什么能击落无人机、一架隐身战斗机如何把雷达散射截面压到<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0001</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.0001\\,\\text{m}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0001</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。本 hub 不讨论「该不该打、怎么指挥、谁来动员」，那些属于战略、指挥与国防制度的范畴。</p>\n<p>军事技术按作战域与代际划分为四大支柱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>一句话定位</th>\n<th>核心难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"weapon-systems/\">1 武器装备系统</a></td>\n<td>陆 / 海 / 空三维平台</td>\n<td>机械化时代的主战平台与火力</td>\n<td>火力·防护·机动的三角权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"information-warfare-tech/\">2 信息战技术</a></td>\n<td>电子战 / 网络战 / 精确制导</td>\n<td>争夺电磁与网络两个「无形作战域」</td>\n<td>攻防博弈的「矛与盾」螺旋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"aerospace-military-tech/\">3 航天军事技术</a></td>\n<td>卫星 / 弹道导弹 / 高超声速</td>\n<td>太空与近空间的战略制高点</td>\n<td>轨道力学与再入物理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"emerging-military-tech/\">4 新兴军事技术</a></td>\n<td>AI自主武器 / 定向能 / 无人系统</td>\n<td>可能改写战争形态的颠覆性技术</td>\n<td>工程成熟度与伦理边界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-去歧义\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub（去歧义）</h2><p>军事科学（11_military-science）下有三个并列 hub，三者回答的是<strong>完全不同层次</strong>的问题，请勿混淆：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;军事理论&lt;br/&gt;(为什么打·怎么打)&quot;] --&gt;|提出作战需求| C[&quot;军事技术&lt;br/&gt;(用什么打)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|提供物质能力| B[&quot;国防教育&lt;br/&gt;(谁来支撑·制度与动员)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|国家意志与资源| A\">graph LR\n    A[\"军事理论&lt;br/&gt;(为什么打·怎么打)\"] --&gt;|提出作战需求| C[\"军事技术&lt;br/&gt;(用什么打)\"]\n    C --&gt;|提供物质能力| B[\"国防教育&lt;br/&gt;(谁来支撑·制度与动员)\"]\n    B --&gt;|国家意志与资源| A</pre><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../military-theory/\">军事理论</a></strong> — 思想与方法层：军事思想（孙子、克劳塞维茨）、现代战争形态、国家安全。回答「<strong>为什么打、怎么打</strong>」。</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub｜军事技术</strong> — 装备与技术层：具体平台、传感器、武器的工程原理与参数。回答「<strong>用什么打</strong>」。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../national-defense/\">国防教育</a></strong> — 制度与精神层：国防体系、国防法规、国防动员、爱国主义教育。回答「<strong>谁来支撑、靠什么制度运转</strong>」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个判断口诀：如果你想知道某型导弹的射程公式与制导原理，看本 hub；想知道导弹在威慑战略中扮演什么角色，看军事理论；想知道国家如何动员工业生产导弹，看国防教育。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>军事技术从<strong>传统机械化 → 信息化 → 智能化</strong>演进，章节顺序即建议的学习顺序，每一章都为下一章铺垫概念基础：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;前置:高中物理(力学/电磁学)&lt;br/&gt;+ 基础工程概念&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;① 武器装备系统&lt;br/&gt;建立平台与作战域直觉&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;② 信息战技术&lt;br/&gt;理解传感器与攻防博弈&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[&quot;③ 航天军事技术&lt;br/&gt;掌握轨道力学与远程打击链&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C4[&quot;④ 新兴军事技术&lt;br/&gt;前瞻未来战争形态&quot;]&#10;    C4 --&gt; NEXT[&quot;延伸:军事理论 / 国防教育&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"前置:高中物理(力学/电磁学)&lt;br/&gt;+ 基础工程概念\"] --&gt; C1[\"① 武器装备系统&lt;br/&gt;建立平台与作战域直觉\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[\"② 信息战技术&lt;br/&gt;理解传感器与攻防博弈\"]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[\"③ 航天军事技术&lt;br/&gt;掌握轨道力学与远程打击链\"]\n    C3 --&gt; C4[\"④ 新兴军事技术&lt;br/&gt;前瞻未来战争形态\"]\n    C4 --&gt; NEXT[\"延伸:军事理论 / 国防教育\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置条件</strong>：高中物理（牛顿力学、电磁波基础）足以读懂大部分内容；第 3 章「弹道导弹/高超声速」涉及轨道力学与再入气动，第 2 章「电子战/精确制导」涉及雷达方程与导引律，遇到 KaTeX 公式可先把握物理直觉再回头补数学。</li>\n<li><strong>快速通道</strong>：只关心前沿热点的读者，可直接读 <a href=\"aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>、<a href=\"emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons\">AI与自主武器</a>、<a href=\"emerging-military-tech/unmanned-combat-systems\">无人作战系统</a> 这三篇 2024–2026 实战检验最充分的题材。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者\">适合读者</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自学者 / 军事技术爱好者</strong>：想系统理解现代武器装备的工程原理，而非碎片化的「参数党」科普。</li>\n<li><strong>STEM 背景学习者</strong>：希望看到物理、材料、计算机、控制理论在真实工程系统中的综合应用——本 hub 几乎每篇都把抽象学科落到一件具体装备上。</li>\n<li><strong>关注国际安全的读者</strong>：技术是理解战略博弈的底层逻辑，本 hub 为「为什么高超声速武器动摇了导弹防御」这类战略问题提供技术解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨学科价值\">跨学科价值</h2><p>军事技术是典型的<strong>多学科汇聚点</strong>，本 hub 的内容与以下方向高度互通：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>人工智能</strong> ←→ <a href=\"emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons\">AI与自主武器</a>（计算机视觉 ATR、强化学习空战、蜂群智能）</li>\n<li><strong>电子与通信工程</strong> ←→ <a href=\"information-warfare-tech/electronic-warfare\">电子战技术</a>、<a href=\"information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons\">精确制导技术</a>（雷达方程、扩频、惯性导航）</li>\n<li><strong>航天工程</strong> ←→ <a href=\"aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites\">军事卫星系统</a>、<a href=\"aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹</a>（轨道力学、再入热防护）</li>\n<li><strong>网络安全</strong> ←→ <a href=\"information-warfare-tech/cyber-warfare\">网络战技术</a>（零日漏洞、供应链攻击、零信任）</li>\n<li><strong>材料科学</strong> ←→ <a href=\"aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>、<a href=\"emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">定向能武器</a>（超高温陶瓷、光学相干合束）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一条贯穿全-hub-的主线-攻防博弈\">一条贯穿全 hub 的主线：攻防博弈</h2><p>如果只记住一件事，那就是：<strong>军事技术的演进永远是「矛与盾」的螺旋</strong>。每一种进攻能力都催生相应防御，每一种防御又驱动新的进攻手段。隐身催生反隐身雷达，精确制导催生电子干扰，弹道导弹催生导弹防御，导弹防御又催生高超声速与多弹头突防。读本 hub 时，请始终追问：<strong>这项技术是矛还是盾？它的出现破坏了哪个旧平衡？对手会如何反制？</strong> 抓住这条主线，零散的装备参数就会连成一张有逻辑的技术演进图。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"weapon-systems","title":"武器装备系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/weapon-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"land-weapon-systems","title":"陆战武器装备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/weapon-systems/land-weapon-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"naval-weapon-systems","title":"海战武器装备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"air-weapon-systems","title":"空战武器装备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/weapon-systems/air-weapon-systems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-warfare-tech","title":"信息战技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electronic-warfare","title":"电子战技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/electronic-warfare"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cyber-warfare","title":"网络战技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/cyber-warfare"},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-guided-weapons","title":"精确制导技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"aerospace-military-tech","title":"航天军事技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"military-satellites","title":"军事卫星系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ballistic-missiles","title":"弹道导弹与防御系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hypersonic-weapons","title":"高超声速武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-military-tech","title":"新兴军事技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-autonomous-weapons","title":"人工智能与自主武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons"},{"seq":2,"slug":"directed-energy-weapons","title":"定向能武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons"},{"seq":3,"slug":"unmanned-combat-systems","title":"无人作战系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/unmanned-combat-systems"}]}]}